OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally, a fine and dry start
OL,6,Fto the day with the odd mist and fog
OL,7,Fpatch clearing rapidly. Turning cloudy
OL,8,Fat times but good sunny spells likely
OL,9,Fand feeling warm.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA fine and dry evening with
OL,12,Fsunny spells. Remaining mostly dry
OL,13,Fovernight but clouding over from the
OL,14,Fwest with the best of clear intervals
OL,15,Ftowards the Norfolk coast. Muggy
OL,16,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
