OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with patchy light
OL,6,Frain developing during the morning,
OL,7,Fpotentially becoming more widespread
OL,8,Fwith the odd heavier pulse through the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Clearer and drier by
OL,10,Fevening. Feeling muggy, especially
OL,11,Fovernight.
OL,12,
OL,13,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,14,FMostly dry and partly cloudy for the
OL,15,Fnext few days, although the odd light
OL,16,Fshower is possible. Feeling warm in
OL,17,Fthe sun and muggy by night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
